ADDITIONAL SAFETY NOTICE — THIS SOFTWARE DRIVES A MACHINE TOOL

THIS SOFTWARE COMMANDS MOTION ON A PHYSICAL CNC MILLING MACHINE. IT CAN MOVE
HEAVY AXES, ENABLE DRIVES, AND START A SPINDLE. A DEFECT, MISCONFIGURATION,
WIRING ERROR, OR MISUSE CAN CAUSE SERIOUS INJURY, DEATH, OR PROPERTY DAMAGE.

THE PENDANT E-STOP IN THIS SOFTWARE IS NOT, BY ITSELF, A SAFETY DEVICE. THE
PRIMARY SAFETY DEVICE ON ANY MACHINE MUST BE A HARDWIRED PHYSICAL E-STOP WIRED
DIRECTLY INTO THE DRIVE / VFD ENABLE CHAIN, INDEPENDENT OF ANY COMPUTER, USB
CONNECTION, OR SOFTWARE PROGRAM. SEE pendant/README.md ("Safety") FOR DETAILS.

YOU ASSUME ALL RISK. VERIFY EVERY CONFIGURATION VALUE (COUNTS PER UNIT, RATES,
ACCELERATIONS, AXIS ASSIGNMENTS) AGAINST YOUR OWN MACHINE BEFORE ENABLING
MOTION. NONE OF THE VALUES SHIPPED IN THIS REPOSITORY WILL MATCH YOUR MACHINE.
